abstract: >-
  Code, results and preprint for WOS-R: cascades and banks of weighted order statistic filters trained with a ramp
  relaxation and deployed as exact rank filters, benchmarked against CNNs, MLPs and Transformers on 1D and image
  impulse denoising, operator coverage, radar CFAR detection and fault-tolerant federated learning.
